  :adr/pattern "Satellite Operations Advisor ⊣ Satellite Network Governor (:satellite-network-governor, grep-verified unique fleet-wide), satcom.* namespaces mirroring telecom.* (6190)/wirelesstelecom.* (6120) module shape exactly (facts/governor/operation/phase/registry/sim/store/satcomadvisor), same langgraph-clj StateGraph. Scope: licensed satellite-network operator (VSAT/broadband-via-satellite, satellite-phone), distinct from 6190's VoIP/reseller scope and 6120's TERRESTRIAL mobile-spectrum scope."
